* <spice_netlist>
* TLC2932A Phase-Locked Loop (PLL) IC Subcircuit
* Composed of Voltage-Controlled Oscillator (VCO) and Phase Frequency Detector (PFD)
*
* Pin Definitions:
* 1. LOGIC_VDD   (POWER) : Power supply for internal logic
* 2. SELECT      (INPUT) : VCO output frequency select (High: x1/2, Low: x1)
* 3. VCO_OUT     (OUTPUT): VCO output
* 4. FIN_A       (INPUT) : Reference frequency input
* 5. FIN_B       (INPUT) : VCO external counter output frequency input
* 6. PFD_OUT     (OUTPUT): PFD output (charge pump current)
* 7. LOGIC_GND   (GROUND): Ground for internal logic
* 8. TEST        (INPUT) : Connect to GND
* 9. PFD_INHIBIT (INPUT) : PFD inhibit control (High: PFD_OUT high-Z)
* 10. VCO_INHIBIT (INPUT) : VCO inhibit control (High: VCO_OUT low)
* 11. VCO_GND    (GROUND): Ground for VCO
* 12. VCO_IN     (INPUT) : VCO control voltage input
* 13. RBIAS      (INPUT) : Bias for adjusting oscillation frequency range
* 14. VCO_VDD    (POWER) : Power supply for VCO
*
